                  </div>
                  <div id=3D"003.001">
                     <p class=3D"oj-normal">1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Europeisk i=
ntegrerad gr=C3=A4nsf=C3=B6rvaltning ska best=C3=A5 av f=C3=B6ljande:</p>
                     <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0" c=
ellpadding=3D"0">
