                                 </td>
                                 <td valign=3D"top">
                                    <p class=3D"oj-normal">GSFP-uppdrag och=
 GSFP-insatser, i enlighet med dessas uppdrag, i syfte att s=C3=A4kerst=C3=
=A4lla</p>
                                    <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cell=
spacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0">
                                       <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                                       <col width=3D"96%">
                                       </colgroup><tbody>
                                          <tr>
                                             <td valign=3D"top">
                                                <p class=3D"oj-normal">i)</=
p>
                                             </td>
                                             <td valign=3D"top">
                                                <p class=3D"oj-normal">fr=
=C3=A4mjande av normer f=C3=B6r europeisk integrerad gr=C3=A4nsf=C3=B6rvalt=
ning,</p>
                                             </td>
                                          </tr>
                                       </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                    <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cell=
spacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0">
                                       <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                                       <col width=3D"96%">
                                       </colgroup><tbody>
                                          <tr>
                                             <td valign=3D"top">
                                                <p class=3D"oj-normal">ii)<=
/p>
                                             </td>
                                             <td valign=3D"top">
                                                <p class=3D"oj-normal">situ=
ationsmedvetenhet och riskanalys.</p>
                                             </td>
                                          </tr>
                                       </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                 </td>
                              </tr>
                           </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <p class=3D"oj-normal">Byr=C3=A5n f=C3=A5r ocks=C3=
=A5 samarbeta med f=C3=B6ljande internationella organisationer om de =C3=A4=
r relevanta f=C3=B6r byr=C3=A5ns arbetsuppgifter, inom deras respektive r=
=C3=A4ttsliga ramar:</p>
                        <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0=
" cellpadding=3D"0">
                           <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                           <col width=3D"96%">
                           </colgroup><tbody>
                              <tr>
                                 <td valign=3D"top">
                                    <p class=3D"oj-normal">a)</p>
                                 </td>
                                 <td valign=3D"top">
                                    <p class=3D"oj-normal">F=C3=B6renta nat=
ionerna genom dess relevanta kontor, byr=C3=A5er, organisationer och andra =
enheter, i synnerhet FN:s flyktingkommissariat, kontoret f=C3=B6r FN:s h=C3=
=B6gkommissarie f=C3=B6r m=C3=A4nskliga r=C3=A4ttigheter, Internationella o=
rganisationen f=C3=B6r migration, FN:s drog- och brottsbek=C3=A4mpningsbyr=
=C3=A5 och Internationella civila luftfartsorganisationen.</p>
                                 </td>
                              </tr>
                           </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0=
" cellpadding=3D"0">
                           <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                           <col width=3D"96%">
                           </colgroup><tbody>
                              <tr>
                                 <td valign=3D"top">
                                    <p class=3D"oj-normal">b)</p>
                                 </td>
                                 <td valign=3D"top">
                                    <p class=3D"oj-normal">Internationella =
kriminalpolisorganisationen (Interpol).</p>
                                 </td>
                              </tr>
                           </tbody>
                        </table>
                        <table width=3D"100%" border=3D"0" cellspacing=3D"0=
" cellpadding=3D"0">
                           <colgroup><col width=3D"4%">
                           <col width=3D"96%">
                           </colgroup><tbody>
                              <tr>
                                 <td valign=3D"top">
                                    <p class=3D"oj-normal">c)</p>
                                 </td>
                                 <td valign=3D"top">
                                    <p class=3D"oj-normal">Organisationen f=
=C3=B6r s=C3=A4kerhet och samarbete i Europa.</p>
                                 </td>
